<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Invisibility</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 20), Assassin (guild level 25)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast invisibility &lt;target&gt;
cast invisibility &lt;object&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast invisibility</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Hides the target from sight for a while: "You become invisible." Only those 
who can see the invisible, for example with detect invisible, still see them. 
It works on objects too.
</p><p>It lasts from a minute up to several minutes, longer the better your mind 
sphere. But when an invisible person is attacked, the invisibility is broken 
at once, and so is hiding. You must be standing. It is also found on potions, 
wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detect Invisible</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hide</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>